/-
Exact oriented Zarankiewicz number z(13,15;3,4) = 114.

The final theorem is Zarankiewicz1315.exact_value, with no upper-bound
assumption. A matrix is thirteen 15-bit rows; Avoids34 forbids choosing
three different rows having four common occupied columns.

Toolchain: leanprover/lean4:v4.33.1
Mathlib: 0df444a360eaa60ab8c11dca51a86af692955474

This single source includes the witness, all finite cases, all integer
certificates, and the proofs connecting them to arbitrary matrices.
It uses the standard Lean bv_decide and native_decide facilities; their
native-computation dependencies are printed by #print axioms below.
No external certificate or local helper module is imported.
-/
